@startuml
' 发布（含订阅联动）— P-001-03 / TECH §5.1 publish / §5.2 ContentPublished

title 发布内容（Console）

actor Operator
participant "Console UI" as UI
participant "ContentController" as API
participant "ContentApplication" as App
participant "Content (Domain)" as Dom
participant "MQ" as MQ
participant "订阅域 Notification" as Sub

Operator -> UI: 点击「发布」并确认
UI -> API: POST /api-content/admin/api/v1/contents/{uuid}/publish
API -> App: publish(uuid, operator)
App -> Dom: 校验 status=DRAFT 且模块数>=1
alt 校验失败
  Dom --> App: ContentStatusInvalid / ConfigIncomplete
  App --> API: 400 业务错误
  API --> UI: 错误提示
else 校验通过
  Dom -> Dom: status -> PUBLISHED\n记录 published_by/at
  Dom --> App: ok
  App -> MQ: ContentPublished\n{contentUuid, subject=CONTENT,\nsubjectId=uuid, triggerPoint=ContentPublishedNotification}
  App --> API: 200
  API --> UI: 发布成功
  MQ -> Sub: 消费事件
  alt 同键存在软删行
    Sub -> Sub: 恢复（deleted_at=null）并更新
  else 不存在
    Sub -> Sub: 新建订阅配置
  end
  Sub -> Sub: 向已订用户推送更新通知
end

@enduml
